@startuml
' Figure 8.6 - Sequence Diagram: AI Assistant Orchestration Workflow
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor white

actor Investigator
participant "Chat UI" as UI
participant "Assistant\nRoute" as R
participant "AIAssistant\nOrchestrator" as A
database "Database" as DB
participant "NVIDIA NIM\n(LLM)" as LLM

Investigator -> UI : types question
UI -> R : POST /assistant/chat
activate R
R -> A : process(message, user)
activate A

A -> A : Stage 1 - classify intent\n(7 intents + UNKNOWN)

A -> DB : Stage 2 - retrieve context\nscoped by accessible_case_ids
DB --> A : cases, evidence, custody (permitted only)

A -> A : Stage 3 - construct prompt\n(system + context + trimmed history)

A -> LLM : Stage 4 - invoke model
alt model responds
  LLM --> A : reply text
else model retired / timeout
  A -> LLM : try next candidate model
  LLM --> A : reply text
else all candidates fail
  A -> A : fall back to context-aware mock
end

A -> A : Stage 5 - validate response\n(refusal detection, strip reasoning)

A -> A : Stage 6 - hallucination check\ncross-check every entity reference\nagainst retrieved context

A --> R : reply, intent, flags
deactivate A
R --> UI : JSON response
deactivate R
UI -> Investigator : renders answer\n(+ warning if flags present)
@enduml
